      "Saint Hilarion": 1,
      "Hilarion was born in Palestine to a pagan family and studied in Alexandria, where he became a Christian. Through Saint Anthony the Abbot he learned to love contemplative solitude, prayer and penance. He withdrew as a hermit to Maiumma, where he founded several monasteries and brought about conversions. He died in Paphos.": 1,
